Moves Split-Flap Clock 1.2.0 onto the splitflap crate: the clock's flap.rs,
sound.rs, lighting.rs and rng.rs are removed and taken from the crate, pinned
to a commit of TimsterAudio/Flight-Board. In the clock repo:

    git apply docs/clock-on-splitflap.patch    (this file)
    cargo build                                (updates Cargo.lock)

If Flight-Board is private, the clock's CI needs read access to it to fetch
the crate.

